ult for symmetric matrices simplifies to\n<span class=\"mjpage mjpage__block\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"14.858ex\" height=\"3.176ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.838ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -1006.6 6397.3 1367.4\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-24-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-24-Title\">\n\\nabla_{\\mathbf{x}} (\\mathbf{x}^T  \\mathbf{x}) = 2 \\mathbf{x}\n</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E24-MJMAIN-2207\" d=\"M46 676Q46 679 51 683H781Q786 679 786 676Q786 674 617 326T444 -26Q439 -33 416 -33T388 -26Q385 -22 216 326T46 676ZM697 596Q697 597 445 597T193 596Q195 591 319 336T445 80L697 596Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E24-MJMAINB-78\" d=\"M227 0Q212 3 121 3Q40 3 28 0H21V62H117L245 213L109 382H26V444H34Q49 441 143 441Q247 441 265 444H274V382H246L281 339Q315 297 316 297Q320 297 354 341L389 382H352V444H360Q375 441 466 441Q547 441 559 444H566V382H471L355 246L504 63L545 62H586V0H578Q563 3 469 3Q365 3 347 0H338V62H366Q366 63 326 112T285 163L198 63L217 62H235V0H227Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E24-MJMAIN-28\" d=\"M94 250Q94 319 104 381T127 488T164 576T202 643T244 695T277 729T302 750H315H319Q333 750 333 741Q333 738 316 720T275 667T226 581T184 443T167 250T184 58T225 -81T274 -167T316 -220T333 -241Q333 -250 318 -250H315H302L274 -226Q180 -141 137 -14T94 250Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E24-MJMATHI-54\" d=\"M40 437Q21 437 21 445Q21 450 37 501T71 602L88 651Q93 669 101 677H569H659Q691 677 697 676T704 667Q704 661 687 553T668 444Q668 437 649 437Q640 437 637 437T631 442L629 445Q629 451 635 490T641 551Q641 586 628 604T573 629Q568 630 515 631Q469 631 457 630T439 622Q438 621 368 343T298 60Q298 48 386 46Q418 46 427 45T436 36Q436 31 433 22Q429 4 424 1L422 0Q419 0 415 0Q410 0 363 1T228 2Q99 2 64 0H49Q43 6 43 9T45 27Q49 40 55 46H83H94Q174 46 189 55Q190 56 191 56Q196 59 201 76T241 233Q258 301 269 344Q339 619 339 625Q339 630 310